- **membershipNumber** = `customerCode + "-M" + YY` (last 2 digits of registration year).
- **checkDigit** = Luhn over customerCode digits.

### Check digit logic (Luhn)
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/CheckDigits.java:13-32`
```java
static int luhnOf(String s) {
    int sum = 0;
    boolean dbl = true;
    for (int i = s.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        char c = s.charAt(i);
        if (c < '0' || c > '9') { continue; }
        int d = c - '0';
        if (dbl) { d *= 2; if (d > 9) { d -= 9; } }
        sum += d;
