### Supporting rule helpers (all in `rest/controller/v1/`)
- `Identities.java` — derived `identityKey` = `normalizedTelephone|email|householdId`; `isDuplicate` (lines 20-33).
- `Households.java` — same last name + address ⇒ same household; `householdId` = `UUID.nameUUIDFromBytes(...)` over `lastName|address` (lines 37-64). This is the only UUID/deterministic-hash-like utility currently in main code.
