- **Telephone normalization:** `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/TelephoneNumber.java:32-45` — `toE164(raw)`: keeps leading `+`/country code, else assumes `+61` and drops one leading `0`, stripping all non-digits. Invoked from `Owner.setTelephone` (`Owner.java:178-180`). Also `Identities.normalize` and `Emails/Households.normalize` do strip/lowercase normalization.
